# Project Context

This is a developer portfolio for the FlyRank Front-end AI Engineering capstone.

## Planned Technology Stack
- Next.js
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS

## Engineering Conventions
- Use TypeScript for application code.
- Prefer reusable React components.
- Build responsive, mobile-first interfaces.
- Use semantic HTML and accessible controls.
- Keep components small and maintainable.
- Avoid hardcoded secrets and credentials.
- Explain important implementation decisions.
- Do not claim unimplemented features are complete.

## AI Collaboration Rules
- Inspect existing code before making changes.
- Explain proposed changes clearly.
- Avoid modifying unrelated files.
- Ask before installing new dependencies.
- Recommend appropriate tests.
- Use Conventional Commits for Git history.